    "summary": "At the start of either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), you may pay 1 Pain token to make this unit [Empowered](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain).\n\nWhile it is Empowered, each time a melee attack destroys one of this unit's models that is yet to fight this phase, roll a D6. On a 2+:\n\n- the model stays in play for now\n- it can fight after the attacker's unit finishes its attacks\n- it is removed from play afterwards",
